{"sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","items":[{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k001","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"파동의 속력은 v=fλ이며 매질 변화 시 주파수는 경계에서 일반적으로 유지된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k002","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"간섭은 위상차에 따라 보강·상쇄가 일어난다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k003","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"정상파에서 양끝 고정 현의 기본주파수 f₁=v/(2L), 한쪽 닫힌 관은 이상적으로 f₁=v/(4L)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k004","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"음의 Doppler 효과는 음원 및 관측자의 매질 기준 속도를 구별해 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k005","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"강도 수준은 β=10log₁₀(I/I₀)","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k006","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"dB이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k007","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"굴절은 Snell 법칙 n₁sinθ₁=n₂sinθ₂를 따르고 높은 굴절률에서 낮은 굴절률로 이동할 때 임계각 이상의 전반사가 가능하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k008","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"얇은 렌즈에서 실물·실상 양의 통상 규약을 쓰면 1/f=1/do+1/di, 배율 m=−di/do이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k009","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"Young 이중슬릿 작은각 근사에서 밝은 무늬 간격 Δy=λL/d이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k010","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"단일슬릿 어두운 무늬는 a sinθ=mλ(m≠0)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k011","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"굴절률 n=c/v.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k012","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"전반사는 높은 n에서 낮은 n 방향.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-wave-optics--wave-k013","sectionId":"physics-wave-optics/wave","unitId":"physics-wave-optics","subject":"physics","text":"얇은 렌즈 부호 규약을 확인한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft